==Miscellaneous==
*Added 4 new [[User Rank]] rewards:
**10 grants +1 Rare Ticket.
**27,400 grants +5 Rare Catseyes.
**27,500 grants +5 Super Rare Catseyes.
**27,600 grants +5 Uber Rare Catseyes.
*Raised [[Ancient Egg: N201 (Special Cat)|Ancient Egg: N201]]'s + level cap from +20 to +25.
*Raised [[Ancient Egg: N203 (Special Cat)|Ancient Egg: N203]]'s + level cap from +20 to +25.
*Raised [[Ancient Egg: N205 (Special Cat)|Ancient Egg: N205]]'s + level cap from +10 to +15.
*Updated the [[Enigma Stages]] tutorial to say "legendary Cats" instead of "Legend Cats".
*Updated most of the openings and endings:
**[[Empire of Cats/OPED|Empire of Cats opening/ending]]: Completely rewritten. See [[Empire of Cats/OPED (Old)|here]] for the old version.
**[[Into the Future/OPED|Into the Future opening]]: Added a new line: "We did end up sinking Japan, though!". Changed "lets" to "let's".
**Into the Future ending: Replaced "Congratulations to The Battle Cats! Thank You Battle Cats!" with "The Battle Cats! The Battle Cats!"
**[[Cats of the Cosmos/OPED|Cats of the Cosmos ending]]: Capitalized "Cats" in "The one weird thing is that all constellations now look like cats. Cats, and only cats."
**[[Legend Stages/OPED|Legend Stages opening/endings]]: Completely rewritten. See [[Legend Stages/OPED (Old)|here]] for the old versions.
*Updated [[Coppermine (Uber Rare Cat)|Coppermine]], [[Uesugi Kenshin (Uber Rare Cat)|Uesugi Kenshin]], and [[Bliza (Uber Rare Cat)|Bliza]]'s descriptions.
*Renamed [[:Category:Mythic Cats|Legend Cats]] to "Mythic Cats", except in the Enigma Stages tutorial.
*Renamed [[Kalisa (Uber Rare Cat)|Divine Kalisa]] to "Divine Kalisa χ", [[Tropical Kalisa (Uber Rare Cat)|Tropical Kalisa, type X]] to "Tropical Kalisa, type χ" and [[Floral Kalisa (Uber Rare Cat)|Floral Kalisa, type X]] to "Floral Kalisa, type χ"
*Renamed [[Master of Logic Newtone (Special Cat)|Master of Logic Newton]] to "Master of Logic Newtone".
*Added [[Anniversary/13th Year|13th Anniversary]] content from [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] [[Version 15.0 Update|Version 15.0]] to international versions.
*Made Infinite [[Speed Up]] and 3x Speed Up functions from [[Battle Cats Officers' Club|Gold Membership]] available to all players. Non-members' Speed Ups are still consumed when used for 3x speed.
**Speed Up is now always available in battles, but won't be automatically on if not used.
*Gold Membership members can now use Gold Cat CPUs for only 1 Cat CPU.
*Replaced 30-day Beginner [[Daily Bonus]] with a new 7-day Beginner Daily Bonus that is available after beating [[Japan (Empire of Cats)|Japan]] in [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1.

